          "branch_file": "throne_of_embers/throne_of_embers_01.json",
          "branch_id": 5,
          "effects": { "health": -10, "strength": 10 }
        },
        {
          "response": "Listen to the whispers in the fire",
          "branch_file": "throne_of_embers/throne_of_embers_01.json",
          "branch_id": 6,
          "effects": { "energy": -10 }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "branch_id": 3,
      "text": "The lords argue in low voices. Each swears loyalty to the realm, none to each other. They watch you carefully.",
      "responses": [
        {
          "response": "Back a single claimant",
          "branch_file": "throne_of_embers/throne_of_embers_01.json",
          "branch_id": 7,
          "effects": { "strength": 5 }
        },
        {
          "response": "Expose their fear of the throne",
          "branch_file": "throne_of_embers/throne_of_embers_01.json",
          "branch_id": 6,
          "effects": { "energy": -5 }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "branch_id": 4,
      "text": "Below the hall, you find old stone and older bones. Runes carved into the floor speak of a vow broken generations ago.",
      "responses": [
        {
          "response": "Restore the ancient vow",
          "branch_file": "throne_of_embers/throne_of_embers_01.json",
          "branch_id": 8,
          "effects": { "energy": -10 }
        },
        {
          "response": "Erase the runes",
          "branch_file": "throne_of_embers/throne_of_embers_01.json",
          "branch_id": 9,
          "effects": { "strength": 5 }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "branch_id": 5,
      "text": "Fire accepts you. Flesh does not. The crown burns away doubt, mercy, and weakness.",
      "responses": [
        {
          "response": "Rule through fire",
          "branch_file": "throne_of_embers/throne_of_embers_01.json",
          "branch_id": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "branch_id": 6,
      "text": "The fire remembers every ruler who failed it. It offers you a choice they never saw.",
      "responses": [
        {
          "response": "End the line of kings",
          "branch_file": "throne_of_embers/throne_of_embers_01.json",
          "branch_id": 11
        },
        {
          "response": "Bind the throne forever",
          "branch_file": "throne_of_embers/throne_of_embers_01.json",
          "branch_id": 12,
          "effects": { "health": -10 }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "branch_id": 7,
      "text": "Your chosen lord ascends — briefly. The throne rejects them. The hall erupts.",
      "responses": [
        {
          "response": "Seize control in the chaos",
          "branch_file": "throne_of_embers/throne_of_embers_01.json",
